 ### [Analytical Derivative of Rendering (Mesh)](6761-analytical-derivative-of-rendering-mesh.md)
-Computes exact gradients for mesh-based rendering by differentiating continuous projection and shading stages. It sets itself apart from volumetric methods by operating on explicit triangle meshes and excludes the non-differentiable discrete triangle selection step. Choose it for geometry and material optimization where visibility is fixed.
